---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, withBase } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms & Conditions" description="The terms for using Calorie Cownter.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>

      <p class="updated-note">
        Last updated <strong>September 19, 2026</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        These terms cover your use of the Calorie Cownter iPhone app and this
        website. By using the app, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please
        don't use the app.
      </p>

      <h2>Not medical or nutrition advice</h2>
      <p>
        Calorie Cownter is a tracking tool, not a medical or dietary service. The
        calorie and nutrition figures it shows — <strong>including AI estimates</strong> —
        are approximate and may be wrong. Nothing in the app is medical, nutritional,
        or health advice. Talk to a qualified professional before making decisions
        about your diet or health.
      </p>

      <h2>The app is provided "as is"</h2>
      <p>
        Calorie Cownter is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis, without
        warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. We don't promise the app
        will be uninterrupted, error-free, or that any estimate it produces is accurate.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the app for anything unlawful.</li>
        <li>Attempt to break, overload, reverse-engineer, or abuse the app or its backend.</li>
        <li>Submit content you don't have the right to submit through the AI features.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>No accounts</h2>
      <p>
        Calorie Cownter has no accounts and no sign-in. Your device is identified
        to our backend only by an anonymous Apple-issued app transaction ID, used
        to count free AI scans and check subscription status. You're responsible
        for activity from your device. See the
        <a href={withBase('/privacy')}>Privacy Policy</a> for exactly what we store.
      </p>

      <h2>Subscriptions and auto-renewal</h2>
      <p>
        Any paid subscription is sold and managed through <strong>Apple</strong>.
        Payment is charged to your Apple account, subscriptions renew automatically
        unless you turn off auto-renew at least 24 hours before the end of the current
        period, and you manage or cancel them in your Apple account settings. We don't
        process payments and never see your card details.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent allowed by law, Calorie Cownter and its creator are not
        liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages, or for any
        decisions you make based on the app's data or estimates. Your use of the app is
        at your own risk.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the <strong>State of Florida,
        United States</strong>, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms. When we do, we'll update this page and the "last
        updated" date above. Continuing to use the app after a change means you accept
        the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
